@startuml sprint-demo-aws-deployment
!theme plain
title Despliegue Sprint/Demo — PROPUESTO, NO PROVISIONADO — cap USD 100/mes

skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor<<aws>> #FFF4E5
  BorderColor<<aws>> #E0A800
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<container>> #E8F0FE
}

cloud "Internet" as internet

node "AWS — una sola region, una sola AZ" <<aws>> {
  node "EC2 pequena\nsubred publica + IP elastica" as ec2 {
    rectangle "Caddy\nproxy inverso + TLS + estaticos" <<container>> as caddy
    rectangle "Account :3000" <<container>> as account
    rectangle "Notifications :3001\n(solo salud)" <<container>> as notifications
    rectangle "Player/Inventory :3002" <<container>> as inventory
    rectangle "Catalog :3003" <<container>> as catalog
    rectangle "Community :3004" <<container>> as community
    rectangle "Commerce :3005" <<container>> as commerce
    rectangle "PostgreSQL" <<container>> as postgres
    rectangle "MongoDB" <<container>> as mongo
  }
  storage "EBS\nvolumenes Docker" as ebs
}

cloud "GHCR\nimagenes" as ghcr
cloud "SQS\nCANDIDATO — no adoptado" as sqs #LightGray

internet --> caddy : HTTPS 443

caddy --> account
caddy --> inventory
caddy --> catalog
caddy --> community
caddy --> commerce

postgres --> ebs
mongo --> ebs
ec2 ..> ghcr : docker pull
notifications ..> sqs : ADR-006 pendiente

note bottom of ec2
  **PUNTO UNICO DE FALLO TOTAL**
  Una sola instancia, una sola AZ.
  Sin autoescalado. Sin replica.
  Sin conmutacion por error.
  Sin recuperacion ante desastres.

  **NO cumple los RNF del producto**
  (100k concurrentes, 99,95 %).
end note

note top of internet
  **NO EXPUESTO A INTERNET**, y no por falta
  de identidad: los cinco servicios verifican
  el testimonio (AUTH_MODE=jwt).

  `public_ingress_cidrs` esta vacio. Y la unica
  URL de retorno registrada en Cognito es la de
  desarrollo local, asi que exponerlo son dos
  cambios acoplados, no uno.
end note

@enduml
